aQcUZHtkuNS0SwaWg&oe=6AB3DD86"}, "display_name": "OUTBLAST", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Shooter"], "long_description": "A rogue viral intelligence known as Typhon is spreading through the system, corrupting entire districts and destabilising the planetary Core. Standard defences have failed. You, the interceptor C11-28, have been deployed.\n\nYour objective: Destroy infected constructs, collect data particles, and purge the system before total collapse.\n\nFast and Furious Arcade Gameplay: Boost, blast and bomb your way through anything that stands in your way in this fast and frantic arcade shooter.\n\n5 different bosses & districts: Defend the core of Perseon-6 and its districts from Hydra, Gorgon, Minotaur, Siren and Typhon.\n\nPower Up: Level up your ship as you blast through threats; collecting data fragments and leaving nothing in one piece.\n\nLeaderboards: Compete against friends, enemies and other players in a race to the top on global leaderboards. \n\n\nConservation lies at the core of Rhino Rock Studios. A portion of our profits is dedicated to supporting impactful conservation projects around the world. By playing our games, you become part of that mission.", "short_description": "OUTBLAST is a fast and frantic arcade shooter for flatscreen and VR. You are piloting interceptor C11-28. \nYour objective: destroy infected constructs, collect data particles, and purge the system before total collapse."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.rhinorockstudios.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rhino Rock Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.outblastgame.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUI